{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruling Horsestown</strong>\u00a0a choice-based roguelike that\u2019ll have you laughing out loud</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the first horse mayor in history!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to chaotic city of HorsesTown. The people wanted to vote for the best mayor, but since there was no one better, they voted for a <strong>HORSE</strong>! Face the harsh reality of the job: survive your 4-year term while dealing with ridiculous and impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/e4ffb1b606519640594fdcd34fa21470.avif?t=1763424657\" width=515 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/bee4930734b2eadb9cab5055577a446d.poster.avif?t=1763424657\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/bee4930734b2eadb9cab5055577a446d.webm?t=1763424657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new turn, new problems land on your desk: political alliances, demands from the people, alien threats, and\u2026 buff horses? Your decisions will have <strong>consequences</strong>\u2014keep an eye on your <strong>Popularity</strong>, <strong>Security</strong>, and of course, your <strong>Corrupt Money</strong>, as well as any other stats you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/ee5efb80af807580c4a1b7330a286752.avif?t=1763424657\" width=340 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/7fbcab2b5a2c56cf8b441f2eb65237d5.poster.avif?t=1763424657\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/7fbcab2b5a2c56cf8b441f2eb65237d5.webm?t=1763424657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to face the unexpected: climate chaos, alien attacks, the collapse of the laws of physics, and situations that defy all logic. In a city where anything can happen, it\u2019s up to you to try to keep order\u2026 or at least pretend you\u2019re in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/2cfe17a80dff9bddb12fe6d1a429090c.webp?t=1763424657\" width=372 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each year\u2019s theme changes based on your choices. Make a deal with the aliens and trigger the <strong>Year of the Aliens</strong>, or oppress your population and trigger the <strong>Year of the Dictatorship</strong>! Each one comes with its own problems, plus items and stats that unlock new choices and situations in other themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/85a4dcc59a589081f3fa62d4e857c652.avif?t=1763424657\" width=166 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different themes (plus secret ones!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 card-triggered events!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and modifiers\u2014change the type of card or call in your contacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than one game mode: Campaign, Single Theme, and Infinite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and trophies to decorate your office.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688510?t=1763424657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688510?t=1763424657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/e0f1f023773d9ad79f3299b9defe7b8ae9f9750e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763424657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/e0f1f023773d9ad79f3299b9defe7b8ae9f9750e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763424657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruling Horsestown</strong>\u00a0a choice-based roguelike that\u2019ll have you laughing out loud</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the first horse mayor in history!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to chaotic city of HorsesTown. The people wanted to vote for the best mayor, but since there was no one better, they voted for a <strong>HORSE</strong>! Face the harsh re